**Dry run** `1 → 2 → 3`:

| step | previous | current | action |
|---|---|---|---|
| start | null | 1 | |
| 1 | 1 | 2 | 1.next = null |
| 2 | 2 | 3 | 2.next = 1 |
| 3 | 3 | null | 3.next = 2 |

Return `previous` = 3: `3 → 2 → 1 → null`.

```java
static Node reverse(Node head) {
    Node previous = null;
    Node current = head;
    while (current != null) {
        Node next = current.next;      // save
        current.next = previous;       // re-point
        previous = current;            // advance
        current = next;
    }
    return previous;
}
```

