Bucket 1 splits on `hash & 4`: 1 → 0 stays, 5 → 4 moves to 5, 9 → 0 stays. Bucket 2: 2 stays.
Table `[[], [1, 9], [2], [], [], [5], [], []]`. `get 5` → 50; `get 3` → None.

